---
import { Logo } from '@ds';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/sections/Footer.astro';

// TODO(Jose): write the text before the release that turns on analytics.
// The headings are what the page needs to cover; the bracketed notes say what goes in each.
---
<Base
  title="Privacy · The Honest Agent"
  description="What this website collects about visitors, and why."
>
  <div class="s-privacy">
    <nav class="nav">
      <a class="home" href="/" aria-label="The Honest Agent"><Logo markSrc="/assets/robot.png" size={40} /></a>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/docs/">Docs</a>
        <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/jlcoto/the_honest_agent">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <main class="body">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="sub">[Who runs this site, and a contact address.]</p>

      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>[PostHog web analytics, in cookieless mode: pages viewed, referrer, browser and device type,
      clicks. Nothing is stored in your browser: no cookies, no local storage. No session recordings.]</p>

      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <p>[PostHog, on its EU Cloud in Frankfurt, as data processor. Cloudflare, which hosts the site and
      routes the analytics requests.]</p>

      <h2>Legal basis and retention</h2>
      <p>[Legitimate interest: understanding which pages help people. How long the data is kept.]</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>[Access, deletion, objection, and the right to complain to a data protection authority.]</p>

      <h2>The honest-agent tool</h2>
      <p>[The CLI and its reports send nothing to this site or to the maintainer.]</p>
    </main>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
.s-privacy{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFFFF 0,#EEF0E8 480px);color:var(--fg-1);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}
.nav{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 24px}
.home{display:inline-flex;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-1)}
.links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 24px}
.links a{color:var(--fg-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
.links a:hover{color:var(--fg-1)}
.body{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 32px 72px}
h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:44px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.sub{margin:0 0 28px;font-size:18px;color:var(--fg-2)}
h2{margin:32px 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.body p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--fg-2)}
@media (max-width:900px){
 .nav{padding:16px}
 .body{padding:20px 16px 56px}
 h1{font-size:34px}
 .sub{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
 h2{font-size:21px}
}
</style>
